  "reasoning": "The defendant knowingly rented his premises to another person for the purpose of operating a gambling machine shop, thereby providing a location for gambling activities. This conduct fits the statutory offense of \"容留他人赌博\" (providing a venue for others to gamble). No other distinct criminal conduct is described (e.g., no evidence of the defendant personally operating the gambling machines or organizing the gambling operation). The self‑surrender is a mitigating circumstance, not a separate charge.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]容留他人赌博<eoa>"
}
